<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">

<head>

```
<meta charset="UTF-8">

<meta
    name="viewport"
    content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"
>

<title>Food Harvest AI</title>

<link
    rel="stylesheet"
    href="/css/style.css"
>
```

</head>

<body>

<nav class="navbar">

```
<div class="logo">
    🍱 Food Harvest <span>AI</span>
</div>

<div class="nav-links">

    <a href="/">
        Home
    </a>

    <a href="/delivery/demo">
        Delivery
    </a>

    <a href="/track/demo">
        Track
    </a>

</div>
```

</nav>

<main class="hero">

```
<section class="hero-content">


    <div class="badge">
        AI-Powered Food Redistribution
    </div>


    <h1>

        Turn Surplus Food

        <br>

        Into <span>Social Impact.</span>

    </h1>


    <p class="hero-description">

        Food Harvest AI connects surplus food with nearby
        NGOs and enables real-time delivery tracking.

    </p>


    <div class="buttons">

        <a
            href="/delivery/demo"
            class="btn btn-primary"
        >
            🚚 Start Delivery
        </a>


        <a
            href="/track/demo"
            class="btn btn-secondary"
        >
            📍 Track Delivery
        </a>

    </div>

</section>



<section class="stats">


    <div class="stat-card">

        <div class="icon">
            🍚
        </div>

        <h2>
            125 kg
        </h2>

        <p>
            Food Rescued
        </p>

    </div>


    <div class="stat-card">

        <div class="icon">
            🤝
        </div>

        <h2>
            12
        </h2>

        <p>
            NGOs Connected
        </p>

    </div>


    <div class="stat-card">

        <div class="icon">
            🌱
        </div>

        <h2>
            86
        </h2>

        <p>
            Deliveries
        </p>

    </div>


</section>
```

</main>

</body>

</html>
